window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>I wanted a fresh start. A wild adventure.</b><br> <br> What I got was sold.<br> <br> On a whim, I signed up for a mail-order bride service, tired of my boring city life. It felt thrilling, dangerous…until I hit <i>accept</i> on a mysterious profile and realized too late that the fine print said <i>no refunds, no returns, no exchanges.</i><br> <br> Now I’m stranded in a remote Alaskan village, surrounded by strangers who look at me like I don’t belong. Especially him.<br> Damian Hawk<b>…</b>the Alpha. A man as cold and untouchable as the ice that cages this place.<br> <br> He didn’t order me. He doesn’t want me….But every time our eyes meet, there’s something there. A tension I can’t explain. Like I was meant for him.<br> <br> I thought I could leave if it didn’t work out. I was wrong.<br> Because in Glacier Valley, <i>mates</i> aren’t chosen. They’re bound by fate. And Hawk?<br> <br> He’s fighting fate with everything he has.<br> <br> But fate isn’t giving up on me.<br> And neither am I.</p>"; 
